{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A modern wellness conversation, practical rhythms, and a 7-day habit builder to begin your next intentional week.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0f1720;--card:#0f1720;--muted:#9aa5ad;--accent:#7bd389;--soft:#112026;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--glass-2:rgba(123,211,137,0.06);font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg) 0%, #061217 60%);color:#e6f3ee}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px;position:sticky;top:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(6,10,12,0.6),transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);z-index:40}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#2ec2b4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#062422;font-weight:700}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin:0 12px;font-size:14px}
    nav a:hover{color:#e6f3ee}
    .hero{padding:48px 28px 36px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border-radius:14px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(4,6,8,0.6);}
    h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#f1fff6}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--muted)}
    .contact-form input,.contact-form textarea,.contact-form select{width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);color:#eaf7ef}
    .contact-form label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--muted)}
    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#33c2b0);color:#062422;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:9px;border:0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted)}
    .aside .card{margin-bottom:16px}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .habit-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
    .habit-list li{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .print-area{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fff7 0%,#e7fff0 100%);color:#05221a;padding:18px;border-radius:12px}
    .check-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);gap:6px;align-items:center}
    .day-box{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.03)}
    .day-box b{font-size:12px}
    footer{padding:28px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center}
    /* modal styles */
    .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(2,6,8,0.6);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:60}
    .modal{width:min(740px,96%);max-height:92vh;overflow:auto;background:#041518;padding:22px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .modal h3{margin-top:0}
    .breath-ring{width:160px;height:160px;border-radius:999px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(123,211,137,0.18), rgba(34,170,135,0.06));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:18px auto}
    .breath-circle{width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),#2ec2b4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#05221a;font-weight:700}
    .controls{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    /* printable */
    @media print{body *{visibility:hidden}#print-root, #print-root *{visibility:visible}#print-root{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;width:100%}}
    /* decorative inline svg */
    .pattern-clip{position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0 0;height:220px;opacity:0.08;pointer-events:none}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">W</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="primary">
      <a href="/index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="/programs.html">Journeys</a>
      <a href="/services.html">What I Do</a>
      <a href="/pricing.html">Rates</a>
      <a href="/testimonials.html">Voices</a>
      <a href="/book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="/contact.html" aria-current="page">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="panel">
        <h1>Let's talk rhythm, results, and the next seven days.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Reach out to start an intensive planning conversation, arrange a diagnostic session, or try the guided exercise tools below. I focus on outcomes, repeatable frameworks, and micro-habits—no medical advice, just practical structure.</p>

        <form class="contact-form" id="contactForm" method="post" action="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">
          <label for="name">Full name</label>
          <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required>

          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required>

          <label for="interest">What would you like?</label>
          <select id="interest" name="interest">
            <option>One-on-one intensive</option>
            <option>7-day challenge</option>
            <option>Team rhythm workshop</option>
            <option>Ask a quick question</option>
          </select>

          <label for="message">A brief note</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell me what you're aiming for..." required></textarea>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center">
            <button class="btn" type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            <button type="button" class="ghost" id="tryGuided">Try a short exercise</button>
            <div style="margin-left:auto;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--muted)">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div style="margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Prefer to schedule? <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="color:#bfeed6">Book time</a></div>
      </div>

      <aside class="aside" aria-label="tools" style="position:relative">
        <div class="panel card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">7‑Day Habit Builder</h3>
          <p class="small">Craft a short challenge—select a focus, generate a daily checklist, then print or download it for the week.</p>
          <label class="small" for="focus">Focus area</label>
          <select id="focus" aria-label="Focus area">
            <option value="presence">Presence: micro-moments</option>
            <option value="movement">Movement: short sessions</option>
            <option value="sleep">Sleep: wind-down rituals</option>
            <option value="nourish">Nourish: simple choices</option>
            <option value="boundaries">Boundaries: time edges</option>
          </select>
          <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px">
            <button class="btn" id="generate">Create challenge</button>
            <button class="ghost" id="randomize">Surprise me</button>
          </div>
          <div id="challengePreview" style="margin-top:12px"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel card">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Quick contact</h4>
          <div class="small">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--muted)">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          <div class="small">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--muted)">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <button class="btn" id="printChallenge">Print checklist</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel card">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Mini demo</h4>
          <p class="small">Try a 2-minute breathing cycle, a journaling prompt, or an intention-setting mini practice—right in the page.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <button class="btn" id="openBreath">Breathing</button>
            <button class="ghost" id="openJournal">Journaling</button>
            <button class="ghost" id="openIntent">Set an intention</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="padding:28px 28px 0">
      <div class="panel" style="display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
        <div>
          <h3 style="margin:0">Why connect?</h3>
          <p class="small">I design short, anchored practices that move toward clearer energy, consistent progress, and repeatable routines. If you want a guided intensive to kickstart a month of change, this is a good first step.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
          <a class="btn" href="/book.html">Reserve a diagnostic</a>
          <a class="ghost" href="/programs.html">Explore journeys</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="padding:22px 28px 40px">
      <div id="print-root" class="panel">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Printable 7‑Day Checklist</h3>
        <div id="printContent" class="print-area">
          <div id="challengeTitle" style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Your 7‑Day Focus</div>
          <div id="challengeDesc" class="small" style="margin-bottom:12px">A compact checklist to carry through the week.</div>
          <div class="check-grid" id="checkGrid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr)">
            <!-- days + items generated here -->
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto">Contact • {{EMAIL}} • {{PHONE}} • <a href="/privacy.html" style="color:var(--muted)">Privacy</a></div>
  </footer>

  <!-- decorative inline svg pattern -->
  <svg class="pattern-clip" viewBox="0 0 800 220" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#1b5e4b" stop-opacity="0.12"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#2ec2b4" stop-opacity="0.08"/></linearGradient>
      <pattern id="p1" width="60" height="60" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <rect width="60" height="60" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0)"/>
        <path d="M0 30 L30 0 L60 30 L30 60 Z" fill="url(#g1)"/>
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)"/>
  </svg>

  <!-- modal backdrop -->
  <div id="modalBackdrop" class="modal-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document">
      <button id="modalClose" style="float:right;background:transparent;border:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px">Close</button>
      <div id="modalBody"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Utility
    function el(q){return document.querySelector(q)}
    function create(tag,props){const n=document.createElement(tag);if(props){Object.assign(n,props)}return n}

    // Habit builder content bank
    const bank = {
      presence: [
        'Pause for 60 seconds of unfocused breath',
        'Name three small wins before noon',
        'Do a 2-minute body scan after lunch',
        'Notice one pleasant detail during a task',
        'Stand and stretch at every hour mark',
        'At end of day, list one learning',
        'Pick a single task to finish before social media'
      ],
      movement: [
        'Walk briskly for 10 minutes',
        'Two sets of 10 bodyweight squats',
        'A 6-minute mobility flow',
        '10-minute standing yoga sequence',
        'A short climb of stairs for 5 minutes',
        'Desk micro-movements for 3 minutes',
        'Active cool-down: slow walking for 8 minutes'
      ],
      sleep: [
        'Screen off 60 minutes before bed',
        'A warm non-caffeinated beverage 30 mins prior',
        'Write a two-line brain dump before sleep',
        'Dim lights 45 minutes before bed',
        'Gentle stretch for 5 minutes',
        'Cool bedroom: lower temp by 1-2°C',
        'Replace heavy meal with a light option if late'
      ],
      nourish: [
        'Add one vegetable to a meal',
        'Swap one snack for a fruit or nuts',
        'Drink a glass of water before each meal',
        'Choose a whole-grain option once today',
        'Prep a simple balanced plate',
        'Batch-cook a healthy base for tomorrow',
        'Notice fullness cues before seconds'
      ],
      boundaries: [
        'Set a 30-minute focus window with no interruptions',
        'Say no to one non-essential ask',
        'Schedule 15 minutes buffer between meetings',
        'Declare an end-of-work time and honor it',
        'Turn off notifications for one hour',
        'Share availability rather than tasks',
        'Leave one meeting early to preserve time'
      ]
    }

    function shuffle(a){for(let i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){const j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));[a[i],a[j]]=[a[j],a[i]]}return a}

    function buildWeek(focus){
      const items = (bank[focus]||bank.presence).slice();
      shuffle(items);
      const chosen = items.slice(0,7);
      return chosen;
    }

    const focusEl = el('#focus');
    const generateBtn = el('#generate');
    const randomBtn = el('#randomize');
    const preview = el('#challengePreview');
    const printGrid = el('#checkGrid');
    const challengeTitle = el('#challengeTitle');
    const challengeDesc = el('#challengeDesc');
    let currentChallenge = [];

    function renderPreview(list,focus){
      preview.innerHTML='';
      const ul = create('ul',{className:'habit-list'});
      list.forEach((it,i)=>{
        const li = create('li');
        const left = create('div'); left.textContent = `Day ${i+1}: ${it}`;
        const cb = create('input'); cb.type='checkbox'; cb.setAttribute('aria-label',`Complete day ${i+1}`);
        li.appendChild(left); li.appendChild(cb); ul.appendChild(li);
      });
      preview.appendChild(ul);
      challengeTitle.textContent = `7‑Day: ${focus.split("")[0].toUpperCase()+focus.slice(1)}`;
      challengeDesc.textContent = 'Print this checklist and check off each day as you go.';
      renderPrintGrid(list);
    }

    function renderPrintGrid(list){
      printGrid.innerHTML='';
      // first column labels
      const titleCell = create('div'); titleCell.style.fontWeight='700'; titleCell.textContent='Day'; printGrid.appendChild(titleCell);
      // days header
      for(let d=1; d<=7; d++){
        const day = create('div'); day.style.textAlign='center'; day.style.fontWeight='700'; day.textContent=`D${d}`; printGrid.appendChild(day);
      }
      // for each item, row
      list.forEach((it,idx)=>{
        const label = create('div'); label.textContent=it; label.style.padding='8px'; label.style.gridColumn='1 / 2';
        printGrid.appendChild(label);
        for(let d=1; d<=7; d++){
          const box = create('div'); box.className='day-box'; box.style.minWidth='42px';
          const cb = create('input'); cb.type='checkbox'; cb.setAttribute('aria-label',`Mark ${it} for day ${d}`);
          box.appendChild(cb);
          printGrid.appendChild(box);
        }
      });
    }

    generateBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const f = focusEl.value;
      currentChallenge = buildWeek(f);
      renderPreview(currentChallenge,f);
    });
    randomBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const keys = Object.keys(bank); const r = keys[Math.floor(Math.random()*keys.length)];
      focusEl.value = r; currentChallenge = buildWeek(r); renderPreview(currentChallenge,r);
    });

    el('#printChallenge').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      window.print();
    });

    // Guided exercise modal
    const modal = el('#modalBackdrop');
    const modalBody = el('#modalBody');
    const modalClose = el('#modalClose');

    function openModal(content){
      modalBody.innerHTML='';
      modalBody.appendChild(content);
      modal.style.display='flex';
      modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');
    }
    function closeModal(){
      modal.style.display='none';
      modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
      clearTimers();
    }
    modalClose.addEventListener('click',closeModal);
    modal.addEventListener('click',(e)=>{if(e.target===modal)closeModal()});

    // breathing exercise
    let timers = [];
    function clearTimers(){timers.forEach(t=>clearInterval(t));timers=[]}

    function breathExercise(){
      const wrap = create('div');
      const h = create('h3'); h.textContent='Two-minute center: paced breath';
      const desc = create('p'); desc.textContent='Follow the circle: inhale, hold, exhale. Repeat for two minutes.';
      const ring = create('div'); ring.className='breath-ring';
      const circle = create('div'); circle.className='breath-circle'; circle.textContent='Breathe';
      ring.appendChild(circle);
      const info = create('div'); info.style.textAlign='center'; info.style.marginTop='8px'; info.textContent='Cycle: inhale 4s • hold 4s • exhale 6s';
      wrap.appendChild(h); wrap.appendChild(desc); wrap.appendChild(ring); wrap.appendChild(info);

      // animation loop
      let state=0; // 0-inhale,1-hold,2-exhale
      let elapsed=0; const total=120; // seconds
      const text = circle;
      function step(){
        elapsed++;
        if(elapsed>total){ clearTimers(); closeModal(); return; }
        // simple timing within 14s cycle (4+4+6)
        const cycle = (elapsed%14)||14;
        if(cycle<=4){ state=0; text.style.transform = `scale(${1 + 0.35*(cycle/4)})`; text.textContent='Inhale'; }
        else if(cycle<=8){ state=1; text.style.transform = `scale(1.35)`; text.textContent='Hold'; }
        else { state=2; const ex = 1.35 - 0.35*((cycle-8)/6); text.style.transform = `scale(${ex})`; text.textContent='Exhale'; }
      }
      // run step every second
      step(); timers.push(setInterval(step,1000));
      return wrap;
    }

    // journaling exercise
    const journalPrompts = [
      'What three small actions would make tomorrow easier?',
      'Name one thing you completed this week and what you learned.',
      'What occupies most of your attention right now? Can you shift it slightly?',
      'Describe a boundary you want to try for the coming day.'
    ];
    function journalingExercise(){
      const wrap = create('div');
      const h = create('h3'); h.textContent='A 5‑minute journaling spark';
      const prompt = create('p'); prompt.style.fontWeight='700'; prompt.style.fontSize='16px'; prompt.textContent = journalPrompts[Math.floor(Math.random()*journalPrompts.length)];
      const ta = create('textarea'); ta.rows=6; ta.style.width='100%'; ta.placeholder='Write here...';
      const timer = create('div'); timer.style.marginTop='8px'; timer.textContent='Timer: 05:00';
      wrap.appendChild(h); wrap.appendChild(prompt); wrap.appendChild(ta); wrap.appendChild(timer);
      // simple timer
      let seconds = 300; function tick(){ seconds--; const m=Math.floor(seconds/60); const s=String(seconds%60).padStart(2,'0'); timer.textContent=`Timer: ${m}:${s}`; if(seconds<=0){ clearTimers(); timer.textContent='Done'; } }
      timers.push(setInterval(()=>tick(),1000));
      return wrap;
    }

    function intentionExercise(){
      const wrap = create('div');
      const h = create('h3'); h.textContent='Intentions: a short framing practice';
      const instr = create('p'); instr.textContent='Choose one clear intention for the day and state how you will notice it. Keep it short.';
      const form = create('div'); form.style.display='grid'; form.style.gap='8px';
      const input = create('input'); input.placeholder='My intention is...';
      const notice = create('input'); notice.placeholder='I will notice it when...';
      const done = create('button'); done.className='btn'; done.textContent='Save intention';
      const output = create('div'); output.style.marginTop='10px'; output.className='small';
      done.addEventListener('click',()=>{ output.textContent = `Saved: "${input.value}" — Notice: "${notice.value}"`; });
      form.appendChild(input); form.appendChild(notice); form.appendChild(done); wrap.appendChild(h); wrap.appendChild(instr); wrap.appendChild(form); wrap.appendChild(output);
      return wrap;
    }

    // actions bound to buttons
    el('#tryGuided').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const content = create('div');
      const h = create('h3'); h.textContent='Try a micro practice';
      const p = create('p'); p.textContent='Pick one: a two-minute breathing cycle, a short journaling prompt, or a single intention.';
      const btns = create('div'); btns.className='controls';
      const b1 = create('button'); b1.className='btn'; b1.textContent='Breathing';
      const b2 = create('button'); b2.className='ghost'; b2.textContent='Journaling';
      const b3 = create('button'); b3.className='ghost'; b3.textContent='Set intention';
      btns.appendChild(b1); btns.appendChild(b2); btns.appendChild(b3);
      content.appendChild(h); content.appendChild(p); content.appendChild(btns);
      openModal(content);
      b1.addEventListener('click',()=>{ clearTimers(); const e=breathExercise(); modalBody.innerHTML=''; modalBody.appendChild(e); });
      b2.addEventListener('click',()=>{ clearTimers(); const e=journalingExercise(); modalBody.innerHTML=''; modalBody.appendChild(e); });
      b3.addEventListener('click',()=>{ clearTimers(); const e=intentionExercise(); modalBody.innerHTML=''; modalBody.appendChild(e); });
    });

    el('#openBreath').addEventListener('click',()=>{ clearTimers(); openModal(breathExercise()); });
    el('#openJournal').addEventListener('click',()=>{ clearTimers(); openModal(journalingExercise()); });
    el('#openIntent').addEventListener('click',()=>{ clearTimers(); openModal(intentionExercise()); });

    // initial sample
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',()=>{
      currentChallenge = buildWeek('presence');
      renderPreview(currentChallenge,'presence');
    });

    // small accessibility: close on Esc
    document.addEventListener('keydown',(e)=>{ if(e.key==='Escape'){ closeModal(); } });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and quick toolkit for the wellness_coach template (chunk 4).

Files included:
- contact.html  — The contact page with a client-facing form, a 7-day habit builder with printable checklist, and three guided micro-exercises (breathing, journaling, intention setting). All interactions run in-page using vanilla JavaScript; no external services.

Placeholders you should replace (exact tokens):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

How it works:
- Habit Builder: pick a focus area and click "Create challenge". The page generates 7 compact actions and a printable checklist. Use the "Print checklist" button or your browser print to produce a printable sheet (CSS includes a print-only view: #print-root).
- Guided exercise modal: open a short breathing cycle, journaling prompt, or intention-setting mini practice. Breathing runs a timed loop (2 minutes default); journaling includes a 5-minute timer; intention-setting saves a short framing line locally in the modal.

Notes for integration:
- The contact form posts to mailto:{{EMAIL}} by default. Adjust the form action or hook it to your backend as needed.
- Decorative SVG is embedded inline in the page (pattern). The broader project may include an assets/img/pattern.svg asset; if so, swap or augment the inline SVG in contact.html.
- No external fonts, CDNs, or images are referenced in this chunk.

Accessibility & printing:
- Modal has aria-hidden toggles and can be closed with the Escape key.
- Printable checklist is limited to the #print-root area when printing.

Customization suggestions:
- Edit the bank of micro-habits in the JS (variable "bank") to match your coaching language and frameworks.
- Adjust timers and copy in the guided exercises to reflect your preferred pacing.

This chunk is focused on the Connect/Contact experience and the micro-tools that help visitors try an approach before booking an intensive."}
BUNDLE_END
